        {
          "text": "Lino akati kacuuno cabwami aakati kabanyama bone aakati kabapati ndakabona Mwanambelele, uliimvwi mbuli mbwaakajayigwa, wakalijisi meja aali musanu aabili ameso aali musanu aabili. Aya meso njemyuuya ya-Leza iili musanu aibili iitumidwe munyika yoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
