        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela naakalibweza ibbuku, banyama bone abapati bali makumi obile abane boonse bakaliwaala ansi kunembo lya-Mwanambelele, alimwi umwi aumwi wabo wakalijisi kantimbwa, amitiba yangolida iizwide tununkilizyo, otu nzenkombyo zyabasalali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
